# Local continuity, drafts and private evidence
contexto/*
!contexto/MEMORIA_COMPARTIDA.md
!contexto/INICIAR_CONVERSACION.md
!contexto/NUEVA_PC.md
tmp/
outputs/*
!outputs/paper/
outputs/paper/*
!outputs/paper/Seismic_CG_manuscript.docx
